{"id":"n27894-2-9","stage":5,"title":"가계 · 家计","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27894-2-9-1","ko":"아버지가 퇴직하시면 쉬시겠지?","zh":"爸爸退休后会休息吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지가","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"퇴직하시면","meaning":"退休，退职","explanation":"퇴직하다：退休，退职；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"퇴직하다","audio":"/audio/d1b8d850c74171cf9fb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82892","senseId":"1","lemma":"퇴직하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬시겠지?","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"d1b8d850c74171cf","term":"퇴직하다","zh":"退休，退职","audio":"/audio/d1b8d850c74171cf9fb9.mp3","entryId":"82892","definition":"从现在的职业或岗位上退出。","pronunciation":["퇴ː지카다","퉤ː지카다"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/646f0f2498adc97a5474.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27894-2-9-2","ko":"아니, 가계를 책임져야 한다고 다른 일을 계속 하시겠대.","zh":"不会，他说还得养家，会继续做别的工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가계를","meaning":"家计，生计","explanation":"가계：家计，生计；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가계","audio":"/audio/1d620aa98613baf98f79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27894","senseId":"2","lemma":"가계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책임져야","meaning":"负责，负责任，承担责任","explanation":"책임지다：负责，负责任，承担责任；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"책임지다","audio":"/audio/82aa72bb90a9c18c41a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24925","senseId":"1","lemma":"책임지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한다고","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하시겠대.","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"1d620aa98613baf9","term":"가계","zh":"家计，生计","audio":"/audio/1d620aa98613baf98f79.mp3","entryId":"27894","definition":"经营家庭经济的方法或家庭的经济状况。","pronunciation":["가계","가게"]},{"id":"82aa72bb90a9c18c","term":"책임지다","zh":"负责，负责任，承担责任","audio":"/audio/82aa72bb90a9c18c41a2.mp3","entryId":"24925","definition":"决定一定要承担某件事或任务。","pronunciation":["채김지다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]}],"audio":"/audio/ab0d21e68a64746051de.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27894","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":4.0567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不会，他说还得养家，会继续做别的工作。","独裁政权终于垮台了啊。","爸爸退休后会休息吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不会，他说还得养家，会继续做别的工作。","爸爸退休后会休息吧？","独裁政权终于垮台了啊。"],"answer":0}]}
